  "notes": "Children enter 1st grade aged 6½–7½ after a compulsory preschool year (excluded), so 1st grade is listed at 7. Osnovna škola: cycle 1 (grades 1–4, class teaching), cycle 2 (5–8, subject teaching). Gimnazija lasts 4 years; vocational 3–4. Cyrillic is official; Latin script is also common."
